  {
   "title": "Operating mode",
   "body": "Data is 1-2 bytes.\nByte 1 - operating mode: 00=LSB, 01=USB, 02=AM, 03=CW, 04=RTTY, 05=FM, 07=CW-R, 08=RTTY-R.\nByte 2 - filter: 01=FIL1, 02=FIL2, 03=FIL3 (optional with commands 01 and 06; FIL1/default selected when omitted).\n\nWith command 06, mode changes in transceive are output.",
   "kind": "panel",
   "pages": [
    10
   ],
