   "title": "SSB-DATA transmission passband width setting",
   "body": "01=FIL1\n02=FIL2\n03=FIL3\n00=Data mode OFF*\n01=DATA1\n02=DATA2\n03=DATA3\n*When 00 is set, also set 00 to 2\nMode Data Steps\nSSB/CW/RTTY/PSK 00 ~ 09 50 ~ 500 Hz (50 Hz)\nSSB/CW/PSK 10 ~ 40 600 Hz ~ 3.6 kHz (100 Hz)\nRTTY 10 ~ 31 600 ~ 2.7 kHz (100 Hz)\nAM 00 ~ 49 200 Hz ~ 10.0 kHz (200 Hz)\nData AGC time constant (sec.)\nSSB/CW/RTTY/PSK AM\n00 OFF OFF\nHigher edge: 0= 2500 Hz\n1= 2700 Hz\n2= 2800 Hz\n3= 2900 Hz\nLower edge:  0= 100 Hz\n1= 200 Hz\n2= 300 Hz\n3= 500 Hz\n",
   "kind": "panel",
   "pages": [
    12
