   "title": "Main or Sub band's frequency settings",
   "body": "00: MAIN\n01: SUB\nOperating frequency data (See p. 10)\n•  Main or Sub band's operating mode and filter\nsettings\nBoth data and filter settings can be skipped. In that\ncase, “DATA OFF” and the default filter setting of\nthe operating mode are automatically selected.\n1 Operating mode setting 3 Filter setting\n2 Data mode setting00: MAIN  01: SUB\n1 Operating mode 2  Data mode setting 3  Filter\nsetting\n00: LSB 05: FM 00: Data mode OFF 01: FIL1\n01: USB 07: CW-R 01: Data mode 1 (D1) 02: FIL2\n02: AM 08: RTTY-R 02: Data mode 2 (D2) 03: FIL3\n03: CW 12: PSK 03: Data mode 3 (D3)\n04: RTTY 13: PSK-R\n",
